OL,3,GNEWSAFerry users frustrated by wait for
OL,4,Awinter schedule
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers say they feel like nothing
OL,7,Fis being done as they face an
OL,8,F"extremely frustrating" wait for winter
OL,9,Fferry timetables to be published.
OL,11,FPeople in the Channel Islands said they
OL,12,Fhad been unable to book any journeys to
OL,13,Fand from Jersey after December, while
OL,14,Fothers were unable to get times for a
OL,15,Fslower service between Guernsey and
OL,16,FPortsmouth.
OL,18,FOne tourist said the delays had put him
OL,19,Foff visiting and other passengers had
OL,20,Fcalled for clarity on the situation.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
