OL,3,GNEWSAFerry users frustrated by wait for
OL,4,Awinter schedule
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrittany Ferries and DFDS, which have
OL,7,Fferry contracts for Guernsey and Jersey
OL,8,Frespectively, said full timetables
OL,9,Fwould be available in the coming weeks.
OL,10,FBrittany Ferries' schedules for it
OL,11,Fhigh-speed services was published in
OL,12,Fsummer.
